WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
What's the point of turning over old accounts now?

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,760
There is no such lighter

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,400
Which of you can keep the fire till today?

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,320
I admit that you have contributed to keeping the fire alive.

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,960
But contribution does not equal ownership

6
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,760
It doesn’t mean you can decide who eats and who goes hungry.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,260
Boar solved

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,900
Such big trouble is coming

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:31,820
Obviously the same

10
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:34,850
Why can't I keep it?

11
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:36,330
How about we ask Su Che directly?

12
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:37,490
I won't ask him to death

13
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,010
But asking for a method is not a request.

14
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:52,120
Where do you stand?

15
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,760
Why is it this kind of fish every time?

16
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:54,880
Because you don't know how to choose

17
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:58,980
Different sea fish taste very different

18
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:00,820
Su Che's side is still fish soup today.

19
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,420
And the salt recipe is more accurate than yesterday
